  "description": "Brings a radio's control channel (M0LTE.Radio's IRadioControl: RSSI, hardware carrier-sense/DCD, PTT) into the AX.25 stack: RssiTaggingTransport decorates any IAx25Transport so inbound frames carry per-frame RSSI/SNR/noise-floor/airtime metadata, and RadioCarrierSense bridges hardware DCD onto the ICarrierSense seam the listener's CSMA gate consults before every keyup. Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
